Discord is free.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:45.620
There's no ads

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:49.900
and it's your best option for chatting with your mates, creating your own server

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:55.940
and even for getting in touch with me because we now finally have our own public community server.

