So click the link below and you can join us over where you can talk souls, lore and vidya

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.500
on a platform that's really just designed for us

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.000
and if you're a part of this server in a few weeks

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:13.760
then I want to do an event where I give you guys the chance to invade me in Dark Souls 3

